      "message": "This line also does not have logic to constrain warning print to only CCD-enabled port.\n\nOn Chromebooks with multiple ports, from cursory inspection, this code may fire spurious Warnings confounding other debug.\n\nParticularly servo-tethered use in lab, where CCD is always enabled, and other side may be hooked up to a video dongle.",
