      "message": "Agreed. So long as there isn\u0027t anything strange like \"multi-port CCD\" or \"CCD on non-port 0\". But that is in the far future.\n\nI think \"port 0\" is a good enough safeguard until there is a dynamic \"port capability\" structure that maps logical topology \u003c-\u003e physical features.",
